schema_excerpt:
interface Response {
  choices: {
    text: string; // The action text for the player
    type: "action" | "dialogue" | "examine" | "move"; // Type: action, dialogue, examine, or move
  }[]; // 1-4 action choices
}

Output ONLY the JSON object, no other text or markdown.

